	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ ウルズハント』より、シールドプライヤーユニットが特徴的な「ガンダム・ザガン」を商品化！",
			"• 「シールドプライヤーユニット」の展開ギミックを再現。アーム部分の各所に可動軸を設けることでフレキシブルに可動。",
			"• 肩アーマーの前側は独立して可動し、腕部の可動域を確保。",
			"• 肩と腕にボール軸を2箇所搭載し可動域を強化。",
			"• ハンドパーツは左右の握り手と平手が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Uruz Hunt\", \"Gundam Zagan\", which features a Seal doplier unit, is commercialized!",
			"• Reproduce the deployment gimmick of the \"Seal Doplier Unit\". It can be moved flexibly by providing movable axes at various locations on the arm part.",
			"• The front side of the shoulder armor can move independently, ensuring a range of motion for the arms.",
			"• Equipped with two ball axes on the shoulders and arms to enhance range of motion.",
			"• Hand parts include left and right gripping hands and a flat hand."
		]
	},
